VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and writes the report, no human touching the keyboard. And the guy who built it isn\'t some random startup founder. It\'s Oge Demore, the mind behind GitHub\'s Code QL and Copilot. X Bow is his third act. In June last year, X Bow did'

